  "question": {
    "text": "The distance between two plates of a capacitor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> and its capacitance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>, when air is the medium between the plates. If a metal sheet of thickness <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> and of the same area as plate is introduced between the plates, the capacitance of the capacitor becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> . The ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"assets\\st0038_1ef824b302c3.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 131px;\" /></p><p>The formula of capacitance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0038_d155d807ea54.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 221px;\" /></p><p>The dielectric constant of metal sheet is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math></p><p>The new value of capacitance is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>Clearly, the ratio,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>"
  }
}